    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nBeautifully modernised and upgraded three bedroom terrace with scope for a possible fourth bedroom. Number 106 Sli Gheal is an excellent property where the owner has very recently carried out several impressive improvements to the finishes, bathroom, ensuites, flooring and the energy rating.\n\nConstructed by Inchagoill circa 2005, this home has been beautifully cared for by the current owner and it is in turnkey condition with a warm, contemporary style throughout. With a west facing rear garden, the ground floor is bright and spacious comprising of a living room, kitchen/dining and a guest WC. It benefits from a second large sitting room on the first floor, which could potentially provide a 4th bedroom if desired. All three bedrooms are very large, 2 with ensuites and a main bathroom. Externally, to the front there is plenty of communal parking while you have a private west facing garden and patio to the rear.\n\nSli Gheal is a popular development of quality homes located just off the Ballymoneen Road. It is very well maintained and benefits from having good local amenities in the area such as the Gateway Shopping Centre and schools while Salthill Promenade, business parks and the city are a short drive away."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall: - \nNewly installed front door, laminate timber floor & coved ceiling.\n\nLiving Room: - \nLaminate timber floor, front aspect window, solid fuel stove with granite hearth, coved ceiling.\n\nKitchen Dining Room: - \nTiled floor, recently upgraded kitchen with modern style, integrated oven & hob, rear aspect window, French doors to west facing patio & garden.\n\nGuest WC: - \nTiled floor, WC, wash hand basin.\n\nSitting Room / 4th Bedroom: - \nLarge, bright room with timber flooring, 2 west facing rear windows, electric feature fire, coved ceiling.\n\nBedroom 1: - \nRecently installed carpet, fitted wardrobe, front aspect window, tv point.\n\nBathroom: - \nRecently upgraded with contemporary finish, WC, vanity unit, bath with overhead shower & glass screen.\n\nBedroom 2: - \nRecently installed carpet, fitted wardrobe, rear aspect window, tv point.\n\nEn-Suite: - \nUpgraded recently, WC, vanity unit, shower, rear aspect window.\n\nBedroom 3: - \nRecently installed carpet, fitted wardrobe, front aspect window, tv point.\n\nEn-Suite: - \nUpgraded recently, WC, vanity unit, shower, front aspect window.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Beautifully presented home</li><li>Two large living rooms</li><li>Possible 4th bedroom</li><li>Renovated/upgraded kitchen and bathrooms</li><li>High energy rating</li><li>West facing rear garden</li><li>Annual management fee approx. 400euro</ul>"
      },
